    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p58-q27-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that $\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}$ is a solution of the equation\n$$\\cos3\\theta=\\sin2\\theta.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{3\\pi}{10}\\right)=\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{5}\\right)=\\sin\\left(2\\times\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}\\right)$, so $\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}$ is a solution.",
          "worked": "For $\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos3\\theta&=\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{10}\\right)\\\\\\cos3\\theta&=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\frac{3\\pi}{10}\\right)\\\\\\cos3\\theta&=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)=\\sin2\\theta.\\end{align*}$$\nHence $\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}$ is a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p58-q27-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "By using $\\cos3\\theta=4\\cos^3\\theta-3\\cos\\theta$ and $\\sin2\\theta=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta$, find the exact value of $\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}\\right)$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}\\right)=\\dfrac{\\sqrt5-1}{4}$.\n\nExpand the identities, divide by the nonzero cosine and take the positive root of $4s^2+2s-1=0$.",
          "worked": "Let $\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{10}$ and $s=\\sin\\theta$. By part (a),\n$$4\\cos^3\\theta-3\\cos\\theta=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta.$$\nSince $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$, divide by $\\cos\\theta$:\n$$\\begin{align*}4\\cos^2\\theta-3&=2s\\\\4(1-s^2)-3&=2s\\\\4s^2+2s-1&=0\\\\s&=\\frac{-2\\pm\\sqrt{4+16}}{8}\\\\s&=\\frac{-1\\pm\\sqrt5}{4}.\\end{align*}$$\nSince $0<\\theta<\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$, $s>0$. Therefore\n$$\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{10}\\right)=\\frac{\\sqrt5-1}{4}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 88
      }
    ]
  },
